{
  "$comment": "What axe-core decides about a busy, labelled element, for the stigmer/require-loading-region lint rule (tools/eslint-plugin-stigmer/rules/require-loading-region.js). Measured, not judged: src/internal/__tests__/a11y/loading-region-markup.browser.test.ts renders every HTML element and every ARIA role through axe's aria-prohibited-attr in Chromium and fails, printing what axe measured, when a list here disagrees. Update a list by copying that output.",
  "axeCore": "4.11.4",
  "namelessElements": [
    "abbr",
    "address",
    "b",
    "bdi",
    "bdo",
    "blockquote",
    "br",
    "caption",
    "cite",
